{"title": "Trump calls for Ukraine leadership change, peace deal", "summary": "Former U.S. President Donald Trump stated that Russian President Vladimir Putin \"would like to see a settlement\" in the Ukraine war. Trump also suggested that Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy should \"get a new leader\" who would be willing to negotiate and end the conflict. Trump criticized Zelenskyy for not holding an election since Russia's 2022 invasion and claimed Zelenskyy \"wants to make problems for the world.\" Trump's remarks were made in comments about the ongoing war.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "ट्रम्प ने यूक्रेन में नेतृत्व परिवर्तन, शांति समझौते का आह्वान किया", "summary_hi": "पूर्व अमेरिकी राष्ट्रपति डोनाल्ड ट्रम्प ने कहा कि रूसी राष्ट्रपति व्लादिमीर पुतिन यूक्रेन युद्ध में \"समझौता देखना चाहेंगे\"। ट्रम्प ने यह भी सुझाव दिया कि यूक्रेनी राष्ट्रपति वोलोडिमिर ज़ेलेंस्की को \"एक नया नेता मिलना चाहिए\" जो बातचीत करने और संघर्ष समाप्त करने को तैयार हो। ट्रम्प ने 2022 में रूस के आक्रमण के बाद से चुनाव न कराने के लिए ज़ेलेंस्की की आलोचना की और दावा किया कि ज़ेलेंस्की \"दुनिया के लिए समस्याएं पैदा करना चाहते हैं\"। ट्रम्प की टिप्पणियां चल रहे युद्ध के बारे में की गईं।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Emphasized Trump's criticism of Zelenskyy for not holding an election since Russia's 2022 invasion.", "Highlighted Trump's statement that Zelenskyy \"wants to make problems for the world.\""], "center": ["Reported Trump's call for Ukraine to get a new president who would agree to end the war.", "Included Trump's statement that Putin \"would like to see a settlement\" in the Ukraine war."], "right": ["Stressed Trump's call for Zelenskyy's replacement, stating Ukraine needs a leader who can strike a deal.", "Reported Trump's assertion that Putin wants a Ukraine peace deal."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["रूस के 2022 के आक्रमण के बाद से ज़ेलेंस्की द्वारा चुनाव न कराने के लिए ट्रम्प की आलोचना पर जोर दिया।", "ट्रम्प के इस बयान को उजागर किया कि ज़ेलेंस्की \"दुनिया के लिए समस्याएं पैदा करना चाहते हैं\"।"], "center": ["युद्ध समाप्त करने के लिए सहमत होने वाले एक नए राष्ट्रपति को यूक्रेन को प्राप्त करने के ट्रम्प के आह्वान की सूचना दी।", "यूक्रेन युद्ध में \"समझौता देखना चाहेंगे\" के पुतिन के बयान को शामिल किया।"], "right": ["ज़ेलेंस्की को बदलने के लिए ट्रम्प के आह्वान पर जोर दिया, यह कहते हुए कि यूक्रेन को एक ऐसे नेता की आवश्यकता है जो सौदा कर सके।", "ट्रम्प के इस दावे की सूचना दी कि पुतिन यूक्रेन शांति सौदा चाहते हैं।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://th-i.thgim.com/public/incoming/qn8ms3/article71570667.ece/alternates/LANDSCAPE_1200/Trump_6_847.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Hindu", "owner": "The Hindu Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/trump-says-putin-would-like-to-see-a-settlement-in-ukraine-war/article71570659.ece", "headline": "Trump says Putin ‘would like to see a settlement’ in Ukraine war", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "Mint", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/us-news/get-a-new-leader-trump-targets-zelensky-after-ukraine-president-objects-to-diesel-deal-with-putin-11791653704450.html", "headline": "‘Get a new leader’: Trump targets Zelensky after Ukraine president objects to diesel deal with Putin", "url_kind": "direct"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "‘Time For Ukraine To Get A New President’: Trump Targets Zelenskyy Over Russian Oil Refinery Strikes", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "Republic World", "owner": "Republic World", "lean": "right", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Trump Says Putin Wants Ukraine Peace Deal", "url_kind": "google_news_wrapper"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "owner": "ABP Group", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5"